.TH ADU_RC_DECODER 1 "2024-01-01" "ADU Agent 2.0.0" "ADU Agent Manual"
.SH NAME
adu_rc_decoder \- decode ADU agent result codes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B adu_rc_decoder
\fIRESULT_CODE\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B adu_rc_decoder
translates numeric ADU agent result codes into human-readable
descriptions. This is useful for interpreting error codes found in
agent logs or reported via the Azure Device Update service.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Display usage information and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Decode result code 0x80040200:
.B adu_rc_decoder 0x80040200
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /var/log/adu/
Agent log directory where result codes may appear.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR adu_status_cli (1)
